{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And the Mishkan you shall make: ten curtains.</b> He mentioned the Mishkan with the definite article because He had already commanded above, ״ועשו לי מקדש ושכנתי בתוכם״. And He should have placed the making of the Mishkan before the making of the other vessels, but He placed the Ark first because it is foremost in rank; yet in actual execution we find that Betzalel placed the Mishkan before the other vessels."], :book :exodus, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:04:30.584984179Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}